{{!
    @template tool_vae/selfpos_record_tree

    The tree of a record: the two sentences of every screen, the invitation to say where one stands (for the one who
    writes), then each node, indented by its level, with its level name, its label, and either the reason it cannot be
    positioned on or the vaeiste's current level and the way to its page. The parts of a node touch: the template holds on
    one logical line, each break carried by a comment.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\selfpos_record_tree. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces) except one key:
    * disclaimerhtml - the two sentences, drawn by the template tool_vae/selfpos_disclaimer

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * disclaimerhtml - string, HTML of a template
    * intro - object or null: text, the invitation to say where one stands
    * nodes - array of {style, level, levelname, label, explain, positionable}: explain is an object (text) or null;
      positionable is an object (words: the current level in words, url and link: the way to the page of the node) or null

    Example context (json):
    {
        "disclaimerhtml": "<p class=\"text-muted small tool-vae-selfpos-disclaimer\">This is not a validation.</p>",
        "intro": {"text": "Say, element by element, where you stand."},
        "nodes": [
            {
                "style": "margin-left: 0rem", "level": "1", "levelname": "Record", "label": "Accompany the person",
                "explain": null,
                "positionable": {
                    "words": "No level given yet",
                    "url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/selfposition.php?userid=7&fiche=RNCP400&rank=D1",
                    "link": "Position myself on this element"
                }
            },
            {
                "style": "margin-left: 1.5rem", "level": "2", "levelname": "Level 2", "label": "Odd coded skill",
                "explain": {"text": "This element cannot be positioned on."}, "positionable": null
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<section class="tool-vae-selfpos">{{{disclaimerhtml}}}{{#intro}}<p>{{text}}</p>{{/intro}}{{!
}}<ul class="list-unstyled tool-vae-selfpos-tree">{{#nodes}}{{!
}}<li class="tool-vae-selfpos-node" style="{{style}}" data-level="{{level}}">{{!
}}<span class="small text-muted me-2">{{levelname}}</span><strong>{{label}}</strong>{{!
}}{{#explain}} <span class="small text-muted">{{text}}</span>{{/explain}}{{!
}}{{#positionable}} - {{words}} <span class="small"><a href="{{url}}">{{link}}</a></span>{{/positionable}}</li>{{/nodes}}</ul>{{!
}}</section>
